  "acceptanceScope": "Actual MP4 export: ffprobe must expose tv range and bt709 matrix/primaries/transfer, and decoded solid annotation RGB must meet the predefined codec tolerances. H.264 SPS VUI is a separate explicit observation and is not required for this MP4 export.",
